WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:02,380
car company headquarters

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:09,450
This is comfortable

3
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:15,200
Take them all away

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,470
Look at it from this high

5
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:22,070
Only then did I realize how powerful Yan was

6
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:23,470
I'm sure I won't be able to finish my search today

7
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:24,910
Stay here tonight

8
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:35,700
It’s not okay to sleep in silence for too long

9
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,740
She needs to be let out to do some exercise.

10
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:46,350
Place the child well

11
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:48,070
I have to continue searching for supplies

12
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,070
for safety

13
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,710
You have to install a monitoring and reading door
